DECISION TheTestsThatNeedAwawaReplayRecordedOutputsAndNoTestSkipsInTheCi
	TITLE "the tests that need awawa replay recorded outputs of the real awawa where it is not on"
		+ "PATH, compared with the real binary where it is, so that no test skips in the CI; the CI"
		+ "installs no awawa and runs no corpus job; brigade embeds no awawa"
	STATUS active
	DESC "a test that needs awawa runs against the real awawa when it is on PATH, and otherwise"
		+ "against a fake that replays what the real awawa produced for the same call: stdout,"
		+ "stderr, exit code and the files it rewrote, each recording naming the awawa version it"
		+ "was made with; no test skips for want of awawa"
	DESC "where awawa is on PATH, a test runs every recording against the real binary and fails on"
		+ "a difference, so that a bump of awawa changing an output fails before a push"
	DESC "the CI installs no awawa and runs no awawa command: the corpus is checked by the awawa"
		+ "corpus gate of the pre-commit hook on the machine that commits"
	DESC "brigade embeds no awawa: awawa stays a prerequisite by"
		+ "@DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites, wrapped as it is by"
		+ "@DECISION.AwawaIsWrappedAsItIs; the fake stands in for it in the tests alone"
		REF @DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites
		REF @DECISION.AwawaIsWrappedAsItIs
	DESC "binds @TASK.B95"
		REF @TASK.B95
	REJECTED "the CI without awawa, its tests skipped, the ruling of 2026-10-06: pull request #52"
		+ "merged with two L016 that broke awawa lint --strict on main, and every CI job skipped 70"
		+ "tests, OK (skipped=70) on main 3deeea2 and on #56"
	REJECTED "the awawa binary downloaded by the CI from the asset of a private release, the ruling"
		+ "of 2026-10-07: no release of awawa exists in any repository of the user, a workflow's"
		+ "GITHUB_TOKEN reads the releases of its own repository alone, and awawa is a tool the"
		+ "user does not own"
	REJECTED "a corpus job running awawa fmt --check and awawa lint --strict in the CI: it needs"
		+ "the real binary, and the user judged its absence minor"
	REJECTED "a fake whose recordings are never compared with the real binary: a bump of awawa"
