	REJECTED "awawa embedded in dist/brigade.pyz or in the repository: a zipapp cannot reasonably"
		+ "carry a 1.6 MB native ELF, and awawa is a prerequisite wrapped as it is"
	REJECTED "a Docker image carrying awawa for the CI: the same third-party binary to host, and"
