	DESC "--allowedTools holds the tools of the role's capabilities, and Write and Edit scoped to"
		+ "the run's progress file, the one write a role is granted beyond its capabilities"
	DESC "the argv passes no --add-dir: the grants of --allowedTools reach the run directory"
		+ "without it"
	REJECTED "acceptEdits, the mode plan section 17 names: a role granted Read,Glob,Grep alone"
		+ "created a file under it, so a read-only role would write"
	REJECTED "no --permission-mode: the mode is then the defaultMode of the user's settings, a"
		+ "setting of the machine brigade runs on, not of brigade"
	REJECTED "--add-dir on the state root: not needed for the progress file, and it opens the"
		+ "ledger and every other run to the client"
