		+ "session ran with claude 2.1.292"
		REF @TASK.B71

DECISION EveryTraceIsAStructuredRecordThatABrigadeCommandReads
	TITLE "every trace brigade writes is a structured, versioned record that a brigade command"
		+ "reads and queries; a text on stderr or in a log is a rendering for a person, never a"
		+ "source"
	STATUS active
	DESC "a trace brigade writes, a subprocess record, an event, a state or a result, is a JSON"
		+ "document carrying schema_version, written to a file brigade owns"
	DESC "an agent or a person learns what happened through a brigade command that reads those"
		+ "records and returns the answer as a document; no reader is expected to search a file"
		+ "with grep, sed or awk"
	DESC "a line brigade prints on stderr or writes to a log renders a record; no brigade command"
		+ "parses it back"
	DESC "the stdout and stderr of a client segment stay raw text, the input of its adapter,"
		+ "returned whole by no command: a run is read through its journal, as"
		+ "@DECISION.ARunKeepsAJournalOfOneShortTimestampedRecordPerActionThatTheReaderTails sets,"
		+ "and the trails through brigade processes, which @TASK.B97 delivers"
		REF @DECISION.ARunKeepsAJournalOfOneShortTimestampedRecordPerActionThatTheReaderTails
		REF @TASK.B97
	DESC "binds @TASK.B72, @TASK.B79 and @TASK.B97"
		REF @TASK.B72
		REF @TASK.B79
		REF @TASK.B97
	REJECTED "traces written as free text and searched with grep, sed or awk: every reader"
		+ "rediscovers the format, and an agent spends its steps searching instead of being handed"
		+ "the facts it needs"
	REJECTED "the subprocess records in the ledger: about 17 000 a day for one project in M1 by the"
		+ "risk R5 of the foundations review, read again by every view of brigade ledger"
	REJECTED "a flag of brigade doctor reading the trails: doctor answers whether the machine is"
		+ "ready now and its exit code says so, the trails what past commands did"
	REJECTED "a command named trails: the word says nothing to a reader; the key trail_days and the"
		+ "files keep the name"
	RATIONALE "brigade mechanises the reading of its own journals, so that an agent asks a tool for"
		+ "the facts it needs and searches nothing itself"
	SOURCE "the user's words of 2026-10-07 at the refinement of @TASK.B72, \"les logs doivent être"
		+ "écrits non pas pour être exploitable en recherche par un agents ia, mais pour que"
		+ "l'agents ia puisse utiliser un outil qui remonte les infos dont il a besoin sans avoir à"
		+ "chercher par lui-même\""
		REF @TASK.B72
	SOURCE "DESC 4 amended on the user's rulings of 2026-10-09 in the refinement of @TASK.B79"
		REF @TASK.B79
	SOURCE "DESC 4 amended and two REJECTED added on the user's rulings of 2026-10-10 at the"
		+ "refinement of @TASK.B97"
		REF @TASK.B97

DECISION APreflightIsANamedSetOfCollectorsAndChecks
	TITLE "a preflight is a named set of mechanical actions, collectors and checks, run on demand"
