		REF @DECISION.AKindOfWorkIsARecipeAnInstanceAnOrder
		REF @TASK.B98
	DESC "binds @TASK.B98 and the tasks of the milestone it creates"
		REF @TASK.B98
	REJECTED "a preflight declaring its own actions: a third way, beside the scans and the recipes,"
