	REJECTED "a distinct word for the named sets, preflight kept for the pull request checks alone:"
		+ "the pull request checks are one named set among others"
	RATIONALE "the refinement of @TASK.B73 did by hand mechanical checks a command could run, and"
		+ "the user wants them useful beyond the refinement"
