DECISION ThePlannerLintsItsPlanFileBeforeRecordingItAndASecondFailureEndsTheRunBlocked
	TITLE "the planner lints its plan file against the project's corpus before brigade plan record,"
		+ "with one correction round, and a second failure ends the run blocked"
