DECISION AWaveIsABatchOfTasksStartedTogetherAndLivesInTheLedgerAlone
	TITLE "a MILESTONE is a goal grouping of the project corpus, a REQUEST the user's text and its"
		+ "plan merged into MAIN, and a wave a batch of ratified tasks started together, named"
		+ "<project>_w<n> and recorded in the ledger alone"
	STATUS active
	DESC "a MILESTONE is a group of tasks that tend to one objective, an entity of the project"
		+ "corpus, STATUS planned|active|reached; a TASK names one or none, and a MILESTONE spans"
		+ "any number of waves"
	DESC "a wave is a batch of ratified tasks started together, decided at start by the CLI from"
		+ "the startable tasks and their overlap; brigade declares no WAVE type in any corpus and a"
		+ "project corpus need not mention a wave"
	DESC "a wave lives in the ledger alone: wave.started carries wave, project, branch and tasks,"
		+ "and the state of a wave is read from its last wave event and the task.state events keyed"
		+ "by it"
	DESC "a wave is named <project>_w<n> when it starts, n one above the highest wave number of the"
		+ "project in the ledger, read and appended under one lock; the name is never changed and"
		+ "is the key of every wave event"
	DESC "the branch of a wave is integration/<project>_w<n>, cut from the integration branch of"
		+ "its milestone, as"
		+ "@DECISION.AMilestoneIntegratesItsWavesOnOneBranchTheUserMergesIntoMainOnce sets, when"
		+ "the wave starts, after wave.started is appended: an open wave without its branch has it"
		+ "cut again, and a branch of the name that no wave.started of the ledger names, as another"
		+ "machine leaves it, refuses the start"
		REF @DECISION.AMilestoneIntegratesItsWavesOnOneBranchTheUserMergesIntoMainOnce
	DESC "a wave the tick starts takes every candidate, its size unbounded; PROJECT.SLOTS bounds"
		+ "the live build runs of the project, not the size of a wave"
	DESC "several waves of a project may be open at once; a task belongs to at most one open wave,"
		+ "and the tick and brigade wave start take their candidates outside every open wave"
	DESC "the CLI forms a wave without a model: the candidates are the tasks STATUS todo of the"
		+ "corpus at the integration branch of their milestone, or at PROJECT.MAIN for a task"
		+ "naming none, as"
		+ "@DECISION.AMilestoneIntegratesItsWavesOnOneBranchTheUserMergesIntoMainOnce sets, with no"
		+ "live blocker, naming no MILESTONE or one whose STATUS is active, a fixpoint admitting a"
		+ "task whose every AFTER is implemented or in the wave; --task <task> ... takes exactly"
		+ "the named tasks, read on the branch of their milestone whatever its STATUS, exits 1 when"
		+ "they name two milestones or one milestone and none, and exits 1 on one whose AFTER is"
		+ "neither implemented nor named; an empty wave exits 1"
		REF @DECISION.AMilestoneIntegratesItsWavesOnOneBranchTheUserMergesIntoMainOnce
	DESC "the tick starts a wave of a project under POLICY.WAVE_START auto, the default, the mirror"
		+ "of PLAN_REVIEW; under ask the user runs brigade wave start <project> [--task <task> ...]"
	DESC "a REQUEST is named <project>_r<n>: the user's text and its planning, STATUS"
		+ "planning|planned|cancelled; its plan, one MILESTONE and its tasks, is merged into"
		+ "PROJECT.MAIN through a pull request from plan/<request> before any wave takes its tasks"
	DESC "the command groups are request (new, show, list), plan (context, record) and wave (start,"
		+ "show, list); wave new disappears"
	DESC "binds @TASK.B165, @TASK.B164 and @TASK.B187"
		REF @TASK.B165
		REF @TASK.B164
		REF @TASK.B187
	REJECTED "a WAVE entity of the project corpus: one commit on the project for a decision of the"
		+ "machine, and the states of a wave are already ledger events"
	REJECTED "a WAVE entity of the operational corpus, the REQUEST going running today: every state"
		+ "written twice, corpus and ledger"
	REJECTED "a command name alone, wave start <request> with no name of the wave's own: two"
		+ "projects whose waves name one MILESTONE share their task states, and a milestone cannot"
		+ "be run twice"
	REJECTED "one open wave per project: the user ruled several, a task in at most one"
	REJECTED "<project>_<milestone>_<n> as the name: a task may belong to no milestone; that a wave"
		+ "spans milestones no longer holds since a wave merges into the branch of one milestone"
	REJECTED "renaming REQUEST to PLAN: plan already names the act and the file, plan context, plan"
		+ "record, plan.awawa and PLAN_REVIEW"
	REJECTED "renaming everything to request: a request is planned once, and its tasks may run in"
		+ "several waves"
	REJECTED "keeping the plan on the wave branch: a wave spanning requests or milestones has no"
		+ "single base until the plan reaches PROJECT.MAIN"
	REJECTED "the branch cut before wave.started, a branch of the name at the head of PROJECT.MAIN"
		+ "taken for a replay: a branch another machine cut from the same head reads the same"
	REJECTED "a wave bounded to PROJECT.SLOTS tasks: one integration branch and one pull request to"
		+ "PROJECT.MAIN per batch of SLOTS tasks, where the slots already bound the runs"
	REJECTED "the tasks of a milestone not started kept draft as the only gate: the user named it"
		+ "the interim, « En attendant, les tâches sont en draft », until a mechanism declares a"
		+ "milestone startable"
	CLOSES @OPEN_QUESTION.TheKeyOfAWaveInTheLedger
	RATIONALE "the user's words: « mon but c'est d'harmoniser les commandes pour éviter d'avoir 3"
		+ "noms qui recouvrent une même réalité. On parle de wave, milestone et request. »; « pour"
		+ "moi, une milestone c'est un groupe de tâche qui tendent vers un même objectif, tandis"
		+ "qu'une wave c'est un groupe de tâche qui vont être exécutés en parallèle, indépendemment"
