DECISION TheTickRunsADueStudyAndCountsEachLiveStudyRunOfAJudgingStudy
	TITLE "the tick runs an active study that is due and not parked, and counts against study_runs"
		+ "every live study run of a judging study, from its collect step on"
	STATUS active
	DESC "a parked study is never due: its next brigade study run, the user's, resumes it at its"
		+ "first undone step"
		REF @DECISION.AKindOfWorkIsARecipeAnInstanceAnOrder
	DESC "a study run is live while the process whose pid it records in runs/<id>/pid lives; the"
		+ "tick launches no study while a run of it is live"
	DESC "study_runs counts the live study runs of every study whose SLOT is not none, whatever"
		+ "step they are at"
	DESC "study pause and study resume exit 1 for an archived study, which stays archived"
	DESC "binds @TASK.B147"
		REF @TASK.B147
	REJECTED "the tick resuming a parked study when its schedule passes: a step parks on a cause"
		+ "the schedule does not clear, and the study would park again at every due round"
	REJECTED "counting only the runs at their judge step: the collect step of a live run leads into"
		+ "the judge step with no tick in between to hold it back, so the cap would be exceeded"
	RATIONALE "the cap bounds the judging runs a machine carries at once, and a study run that"
		+ "began collecting will judge in the same process; one study never runs twice at once, as"
		+ "the user ruled"
		REF @TASK.B147
	SOURCE "pull request #148 of the brigade repository, delivering @TASK.B147"
		REF @TASK.B147

DECISION TheBuildProcedureCommitsBeforeItsCheck
	TITLE "build-task commits the work before brigade task check, and corrects a failing check in a"
