	REJECTED "the check before the commits, the order SPEC 2 of the task worded until the review of"
		+ "pull request #151: brigade task check refuses a worktree whose files differ from HEAD,"
		+ "and brigade task pr a check that is not of HEAD"
	RATIONALE "a verdict of brigade task check is always of HEAD exactly, @TASK.B142; a run that"
		+ "checked before committing would be refused, and one that rewrote its commits after the"
		+ "check would open no pull request"
		REF @TASK.B142
	SOURCE "pull request #151 of the brigade repository, delivering @TASK.B141"
