DECISION PrListReadsEveryPullRequestAfreshAndIsAbsentOnlyAsABuiltIn
	TITLE "pr-list reads every pull request of the state asked, with no bound, collected afresh on"
		+ "every call, and only a built-in row of collectors list is ever absent"
	STATUS active
	DESC "pr-list declares cache false: the state, the review and the check runs of a pull request"
		+ "move on the forge without HEAD moving, so no cache key brigade can read would invalidate"
		+ "its entry"
		REF @TASK.B146
		REF @DECISION.ACollectorDeclaresInItsDocumentWhetherItIsCached
	DESC "the forge adapter reads the pull requests through gh api graphql --paginate --slurp over"
		+ "repository.pullRequests, a hundred per page and every page, within the 600 seconds a"
		+ "collector is given; the check runs of a pull request are the first hundred contexts of"
		+ "the status check rollup of its last commit"
	DESC "the absence of a collector is decided by its name and the FORGE of the registered"
		+ "project, in brigade/collecting/find_absence.py; collectors list sets it on built-in rows"
		+ "alone, since a project, machine or PATH collector of the same name is resolved first and"
		+ "answers without the forge"
	REJECTED "gh api --paginate on the REST pulls endpoint, which reads every pull request: it"
		+ "carries neither the review decision nor the check runs, a second call per pull request"
	REJECTED "gh pr list --limit 1000: a project holding more pull requests of the state asked"
		+ "loses the oldest beyond the bound, and the document gives no sign of the cut"
	REJECTED "pr-list cached and keyed on HEAD as the git built-ins are: a pull request merged or"
		+ "reviewed since would be answered from the cache"
	REJECTED "collectors list going on when awawa is missing, the registry read as no project: a"
		+ "second path for a tool brigade doctor already requires"
	RATIONALE "@TASK.B146 names the items and the absence and leaves the cache and the rows of the"
		+ "absence to its delivery; its SPEC counts the pull requests of the project with no bound"
		REF @TASK.B146
	SOURCE "pull request #155 of the brigade repository, delivering @TASK.B146 on 2026-10-18"
		REF @TASK.B146
	SOURCE "the user's ruling of 2026-10-18 in the review of pull request #155 of the brigade"
		+ "repository, « GraphQL paginé, sans borne »: the bound of 1000 rejected"
