DECISION SchedulerStatusJudgesTheTickStaleStrictlyPastItsMinutesAndSummarisesTheOpenWavesAlone
	TITLE "brigade scheduler status judges the last tick stale once strictly older than"
		+ "tick_stale_after minutes, an integer of 1 or more, and lists the paused waves and the"
