		+ "earlier one; the next tick plans them again from the facts"
	DESC "a failed action is one whose executor raised a BrigadeError; any other exception is a"
		+ "defect of brigade and ends the tick as before"
	DESC "a heartbeat that holds no actions_failed, written before failed actions were counted,"
		+ "reads as none failed"
	DESC "binds @TASK.B166"
		REF @TASK.B166
	REJECTED "every round applying the plan it is given: an action that fails on a persistent fact"
		+ "is planned again at each round and recorded up to ROUND_CAP times in one tick"
	REJECTED "the rounds stopped at the first round holding a failure: the merge of one project"
		+ "would no longer make its dependents startable in the same tick because another project"
		+ "failed"
	REJECTED "every exception recorded as a failed action: a defect of brigade, or an"
		+ "AssertionError of a test double, would be hidden in the ledger behind a tick that exits"
		+ "0"
	RATIONALE "@DECISION.TheTickIsAPurePlannerAndAnExecutorThatRecordsEveryAction makes a failed"
		+ "action an event and the tick go on; within one tick the facts a failed action rests on"
		+ "have not changed, so applying it again records the same failure"
		REF @DECISION.TheTickIsAPurePlannerAndAnExecutorThatRecordsEveryAction
	SOURCE "taken in the delivery of @TASK.B166, pull request #185"
		REF @TASK.B166

