DECISION TheInboxIsAnAppendOnlySignalsFileFoldedByFingerprint
	TITLE "the inbox is $XDG_STATE_HOME/brigade/inbox/signals.jsonl, appended under its lock and"
		+ "folded by fingerprint when read; a signal is named by a prefix of the sha256 of its"
		+ "fingerprint, and its ledger events are inbox.recorded and inbox.dismissed"
	STATUS active
	DESC "a recording or a dismissal is one appended line; count, age and status are computed by"
		+ "the reader, never stored"
	DESC "a connector, a scan or a study that records a signal sets its kind and its fingerprint; a"
		+ "fingerprint is the fact, so the same fact recorded twice is one signal counted twice"
	DESC "a note and a study answer, having no key of their own, are fingerprinted by the sha256 of"
		+ "their content"
	DESC "binds @TASK.B22"
		REF @TASK.B22
	REJECTED "one line per fingerprint, the file rewritten atomically at each recording: the"
		+ "occurrences of a signal are lost, and the Blueprint draws the connectors as CLI append"
	REJECTED "a sequential id s<n>: a counter to keep under the lock, where a hash prefix needs no"
		+ "state and names the same fingerprint on every machine"
	REJECTED "the fingerprint itself as the id: that of a review thread runs to a path and a line,"
		+ "too long to type"
	REJECTED "the ledger event signal.recorded: it records the OS signals of a run segment,"
		+ "brigade/runs/run_segments.py, and renaming it would change the meaning of lines already"
		+ "written"
	REJECTED "a signal per recording, with no deduplication: a dismissal would hold for one"
		+ "occurrence, and the same fact would come back as new"
	RATIONALE "the buffer of the outer loop must count the repetitions of one fact for the triage"
		+ "to see a pattern, and keep a dismissed fact dismissed; an append-only file keeps every"
		+ "occurrence as the ledger does"
	SOURCE "the user's rulings of 2026-10-24 in the refinement of @TASK.B22"
		REF @TASK.B22

DECISION ConnectorsRunAtEachTickAndRecordAFactOnce
	TITLE "a connector is a built-in collector the tick runs for every active project at each tick,"
		+ "recording each fact the inbox does not hold yet, under a fingerprint naming the fact"
		+ "itself"
	STATUS active
