		+ "head being a new fact"
	DESC "binds @TASK.B23 and @TASK.B24"
		REF @TASK.B23
		REF @TASK.B24
	REJECTED "the connectors as scans, studies with SLOT none and OUTPUT inbox: the scans arrive"
		+ "with task B33 in M4, and M2 would wait on them"
	REJECTED "a recording at each tick that sees the fact: the count would measure how long a fact"
		+ "lived, not how often it happened"
	REJECTED "rt:<pull request>:<path>:<line>, the Blueprint's example: two threads on one line"
		+ "would be one signal"
	RATIONALE "the inbox counts repetitions for the triage to see a pattern; a connector that polls"
		+ "must not turn its own polling into repetitions"
	SOURCE "the user's rulings of 2026-10-24 in the refinement of @TASK.B23 to @TASK.B26"
		REF @TASK.B23
		REF @TASK.B26

DECISION AnAtomOfAwawaIsDecodedByAwawasGrammarAndNeverByJson
	TITLE "a string atom of awawa's JSON output is decoded by brigade/corpus/decode_atom.py, which"
		+ "undoes \\\" and \\\\ alone and keeps every other backslash; no reader calls json.loads"
		+ "on an atom"
