DECISION AVerificationAfterTheFirstVerdictJudgesThePreviousFindingsAndTheRepairDiff
	TITLE "once a verdict is recorded on a pull request, a verification run judges the answer given"
		+ "to each finding of the previous verdict and the diff since the head that verdict judged,"
		+ "raising there no new finding of grade low"
	STATUS active
	DESC "the first verification of a pull request judges the whole pull request, as @TASK.B16 says"
		REF @TASK.B16
	DESC "after the first verdict, a verification run judges each finding of the previous verdict"
		+ "by the answer the remediation recorded for it: a fix, checked in the repair diff, or a"
		+ "challenge, accepted only when its argument holds"
	DESC "the verdict is pass when every finding of the previous verdict is fixed or soundly"
		+ "challenged and no new finding is raised; otherwise it is changes, carrying the findings"
		+ "still open and the new ones, and the task goes back to remediation"
