DECISION ARepairRoundIsOneLaunchOfTheRemediateOrTheBuildSlotAndARebaseRunCountsNone
	TITLE "a repair round is one launch by the tick of a run of the remediate or the build slot on"
		+ "a task of a wave, counted since the last verdict or the last requeue of the task; a run"
