DECISION ACheckRunFailsOnFailureTimeoutOrStartupFailureAndTheTickRunsItsConnectorsAfterItsRounds
	TITLE "check-runs takes as failing the conclusions failure, timed_out and startup_failure,"
		+ "counts them per pull request or branch, and the tick applies its connectors once, after"
		+ "its rounds"
	STATUS active
