	REJECTED "the connector actions planned by plan in every round: the rounds plan again until the"
		+ "plan is empty, so a connector would run up to the round cap at each tick"
	REJECTED "a failing check run as any conclusion but success, as the preflight reads it: a"
		+ "cancelled or skipped check is no failure, and a pending one would be recorded before it"
		+ "concludes"
	REJECTED "the listing of pr-list widened with the head and the links of the check runs: the"
