	REJECTED "a pull request with no check run awaited until ten minutes after its head commit: the"
		+ "user ruled ten minutes too long, one minute enough for GitHub Actions to create its"
		+ "suite"
	REJECTED "the commit date of the head as its age: build-task commits before brigade task check,"
