	REJECTED "the paths-ignore of .github/workflows/ci.yml removed so that every pull request gets"
		+ "a check run: the user ruled the workflow unchanged"
	RATIONALE "@TASK.B24 names the failing check runs and leaves open which conclusions fail, the"
		+ "shape of summary and where the tick runs its connectors"
		REF @TASK.B24
	SOURCE "taken in the delivery of @TASK.B24, pull request 212"
		REF @TASK.B24
