DECISION ARequeueOfATaskWhosePullRequestIsOpenSendsItBackToItsPreflight
	TITLE "brigade wave requeue of a parked task whose pull request is open records task.state"
		+ "pr_open, not queued: the head goes through preflight and verification again and the"
		+ "remediation receives the findings; a task without a pull request is queued and its build"
		+ "run launched"
	STATUS active
	DESC "a requeue of a parked task whose pull request is open records task.state pr_open; the"
		+ "next tick preflights the head of the pull request, verifies it, and a verdict changes"
		+ "launches the remediation with its findings"
	DESC "a requeue of a parked task without a pull request records task.state queued, and the next"
		+ "tick launches its build run, as @TASK.B210 sets"
		REF @TASK.B210
	DESC "a requeue restarts the count of the repair rounds of the task, as DESC 1 of"
		+ "@DECISION.ARepairRoundIsOneLaunchOfTheRemediateOrTheBuildSlotAndARebaseRunCountsNone"
		+ "says"
		REF @DECISION.ARepairRoundIsOneLaunchOfTheRemediateOrTheBuildSlotAndARebaseRunCountsNone
	DESC "binds @TASK.B217; until it is delivered brigade wave requeue records queued for every"
		+ "task"
		REF @TASK.B217
	REJECTED "queued recorded for every requeued task, as brigade wave requeue did until the ruling"
		+ "of 2026-10-29: on a task with an open pull request the tick launched a build run with"
		+ "the brief Deliver the task, which received neither the verdict nor the preflight"
		+ "findings, did nothing or rebased and force-pushed on its own, and the next verdict"
		+ "re-raised the previous findings and parked the task at once"
	REJECTED "changes_requested recorded on the requeue, the remediation launched at once: the head"
		+ "was not preflighted since the park, and a failing check or a privacy finding would"
		+ "surface only at the next verdict; pr_open is the one state from which the preflight of a"
		+ "head opens the next verification"
	RATIONALE "observed on 2026-10-28 on the requeues of @TASK.B210 and @TASK.B28:"
		+ "brigade/commands/wave_requeue.py appends task.state queued alone, brigade/tick/plan.py"
		+ "then plans LaunchTask and the build run starts on build-brief.md.tpl, whose package"
		+ "carries the worktree, the task, the rules, AGENTS.md and the acceptance and no finding;"
		+ "the runs bb222f and cb6753 did nothing and 28179e rebased and force-pushed on its own"
		REF @TASK.B210
		REF @TASK.B28
	RATIONALE "a verification after the first verdict judges the answer to each previous finding,"
		+ "@DECISION.AVerificationAfterTheFirstVerdictJudgesThePreviousFindingsAndTheRepairDiff, so"
		+ "a head requeued without a repair is judged on the findings it left open, and the"
		+ "remediation that follows receives them; pr_open is the state a rebased head moves back"
		+ "to for the same reason, @DECISION.ACleanRebaseSendsTheTaskBackToItsPreflight"
		REF @DECISION.AVerificationAfterTheFirstVerdictJudgesThePreviousFindingsAndTheRepairDiff
		REF @DECISION.ACleanRebaseSendsTheTaskBackToItsPreflight
