		REF @TASK.B51
	DESC "the Markdown of a report, printed by brigade reports show and published by the wave"
		+ "report, is rendered by one function, brigade/reports/render_report_markdown.py, its"
		+ "manual tests and tester steps as tables"
	REJECTED "the answer.awawa of each run directory as the source: the retention of runs/ removes"
