DECISION HomeListsAStudyWhoseLastOrderParkedAsFailedAndADueStudyByTheRuleOfTheTick
	TITLE "brigade status lists a study as failed and parked when its last order parked, and as due"
		+ "by the rule the tick plans studies with"
