DECISION TheLedgerOfAWaveCountsTheRoundsOfATaskAsTheTickDoes
	TITLE "brigade ledger --wave counts the rounds of a task as the tick does: its fixing states"
		+ "less those a rebase run launched, the rebase runs read from the run.finished events of"
		+ "the wave"
	STATUS active
	REJECTED "the rounds of the pr.merged event alone: a task not merged yet would show none"
	REJECTED "the fixing states alone: a rebase launch would count as a round"
	RATIONALE "a rebase run counts no round, as"
		+ "@DECISION.ARepairRoundIsOneLaunchOfTheRemediateOrTheBuildSlotAndARebaseRunCountsNone"
		+ "sets; the Wave view of @TASK.B28 reads the rounds from the ledger of the wave; a rebase"
		+ "run still live has no run.finished yet, so its launch counts until it finishes"
		REF @TASK.B28
		REF @DECISION.ARepairRoundIsOneLaunchOfTheRemediateOrTheBuildSlotAndARebaseRunCountsNone
	SOURCE "the build run of @TASK.B28 of 2026-10-28"
		REF @TASK.B28

