DECISION AScanRecordsOneSignalPerItemFingerprintedByTheItemAndEachBuiltInScanRunsPerProject
	TITLE "a scan records one inbox signal of kind scan per item its collectors print,"
		+ "fingerprinted <study>:<project>:<the item's fingerprint>, and brigade ships each"
		+ "built-in scan once per registered project, named <scan>_<project>"
	STATUS active
	DESC "an item of a scan's collector carries a fingerprint key naming the fact it reports; an"
		+ "item without one fails the run; no item, no signal"
	DESC "binds @TASK.B33 and @TASK.B34"
		REF @TASK.B33
		REF @TASK.B34
	REJECTED "one signal per run fingerprinted by the hash of the answer, as the inbox output does"
		+ "for a study with a judging run: the answer carries the run id, so every run records a"
		+ "new signal and a dismissal never holds"
	REJECTED "one signal per run fingerprinted by the hash of its items: one new fact among ten"
		+ "known ones makes the whole a new signal"
	REJECTED "one built-in per scan collecting over every registered project: a failing project"
		+ "parks the scan of every other"
	RATIONALE "a fingerprint is the fact, as"
		+ "@DECISION.TheInboxIsAnAppendOnlySignalsFileFoldedByFingerprint sets, and a scan finds"
		+ "several facts at once"
		REF @DECISION.TheInboxIsAnAppendOnlySignalsFileFoldedByFingerprint
	RATIONALE "the built-in is named <scan>_<project> because awawa refuses a hyphen in an entity"
		+ "name (lint L017), so a STUDY could not replace a built-in scan otherwise"
	SOURCE "the user's rulings of 2026-11-01 in the refinement of @TASK.B33 and @TASK.B34"
		REF @TASK.B33
		REF @TASK.B34
	SOURCE "the user's ruling of 2026-11-01 on the question of the build run of @TASK.B33, run"
		+ "20261101T151054Z-bf1d28: the built-in scans are named with underscores"
		REF @TASK.B33

DECISION TheDocumentationIsWrittenInWikiAndPublishedToTheGitHubWikiOnEachPushToMain
	TITLE "the documentation is Markdown pages in wiki/ of the repository, published to the GitHub"
		+ "wiki delairec/brigade.wiki.git by a workflow on each push to main; README.md keeps what"
		+ "brigade is, the minimal install, the basic command and the link to the wiki"
	STATUS active
	DESC "the documentation of brigade is a set of Markdown pages in wiki/ of the repository, one"
		+ "page per subject, changed by a branch and a pull request like any other file;"
		+ "wiki/Home.md is the entry and names every page with what it answers"
	DESC "a GitHub Actions workflow publishes wiki/ to https://github.com/delairec/brigade.wiki.git"
		+ "on each push to main, and nothing else writes that repository: its master is wiki/ as"
		+ "main holds it"
	DESC "README.md holds what brigade is, the minimal install, the basic command and the link"
		+ "https://github.com/delairec/brigade/wiki; everything else it held is a wiki page"
	DESC "docs/, HANDOFF.md and artifact/ stay where they are; a wiki page may link to them"
	DESC "the output of brigade adapter matrix --markdown for the built-in adapters stands, between"
		+ "its two marker comments, on the wiki page on client adapters, and the guard of"
		+ "tests/guards checks that page; it amends DESC 3 of"
		+ "@DECISION.TheSupportedClientsTableIsGeneratedFromTheProbes, DESC 5 of"
		+ "@DECISION.BrigadeNamesNoAiClientOutsideItsAdapters, DESC 6 of"
		+ "@DECISION.TheCodeIsOneFlatPackageWhoseSubpackagesFollowTheComponents and DESC 6 of"
		+ "@DECISION.EveryDocumentBrigadeReadsBackAcceptsAnAwawaFormAndTextIsARenderingHandedWhole,"
		+ "which placed it in the README"
		REF @DECISION.TheSupportedClientsTableIsGeneratedFromTheProbes
		REF @DECISION.BrigadeNamesNoAiClientOutsideItsAdapters
		REF @DECISION.TheCodeIsOneFlatPackageWhoseSubpackagesFollowTheComponents
		REF @DECISION.EveryDocumentBrigadeReadsBackAcceptsAnAwawaFormAndTextIsARenderingHandedWhole
	DESC "an IMPL anchor of the corpus into README.md names the wiki page that holds its text"
	DESC "wiki/** joins the paths-ignore of the pull_request trigger of ci.yml; it amends DESC 1 of"
		+ "@DECISION.APullRequestTouchingOnlyTheCorpusOrDocumentationRunsNoCodeJob"
		REF @DECISION.APullRequestTouchingOnlyTheCorpusOrDocumentationRunsNoCodeJob
	DESC "binds the draft tasks whose SPEC writes in the README, @TASK.B39, @TASK.B52, @TASK.B93,"
		+ "@TASK.B107, @TASK.B108 and @TASK.B163: what they document lands on the wiki page of"
		+ "their subject; the SPEC of an implemented task naming the README stays as it was"
		+ "written, its IMPL anchors alone move"
		REF @TASK.B39
		REF @TASK.B52
		REF @TASK.B93
		REF @TASK.B107
		REF @TASK.B108
		REF @TASK.B163
	REJECTED "the pages written in the wiki repository itself: it renders master alone, carries no"
		+ "branch and no pull request, and is not cloned with the repository, so an agent in a"
		+ "worktree does not see it and awawa lint resolves no anchor into it"
	REJECTED "README.md kept whole beside the wiki: one fact in two homes, and every anchor of the"
		+ "corpus kept on the copy"
	REJECTED "docs/, HANDOFF.md and artifact/ moved to the wiki: the dated reports and the handoff"
		+ "are never rewritten, and the Artifact sources are redone from their briefs and published"
		+ "by the Artifact tool"
	RATIONALE "the user ruled on 2026-11-01 that the documentation moves from the README to a wiki"
		+ "read by agents and people alike; a GitHub wiki is a git repository of its own that"
		+ "renders master alone, carries no pull request and is not cloned with the repository, so"
		+ "the pages are written in wiki/, reviewed like the code and checked by awawa lint, and"
		+ "the wiki repository is their rendering"
	RATIONALE "README.md keeps the basic command, which the rule project_commands_from_readme of"
		+ "the instructions corpus reads there; the other commands are on the wiki"
	SOURCE "the user's request of 2026-11-01, \"j'ai créé un wiki pour ce repo, je voudrais qu'on"
		+ "déplace la doc vers le wiki et qu'on présente ça correctement avec des pages et tout"
		+ "pour que ça soit facile à lire, comprendre et trouver l'info qu'on cherche. Pour être"
		+ "utilisé à la fois par ia et humains. Pour le moment on fait ce travail sur une"
		+ "branche.\""
	SOURCE "the user's rulings of 2026-11-01 on the three questions of the session: \"wiki/ +"
		+ "publication auto\", \"Court + lien wiki\", \"README seulement\""
